description: Core.Application CQRS — MediatR handlers orchestrate; no persistence or HTTP
globs: src/Core/Core.Application/**/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
---

# Application layer

```text
Feature/Commands|Queries/Name/NameCommand.cs
                              NameCommandHandler.cs
                              NameCommandValidator.cs
```

- Handlers depend on **contracts**, not EF/DbContext/controllers.
- Validators: FluentValidation. Pipeline already runs `ValidationBehavior`.
- Hash passwords and issue tokens via `IPasswordHasher` / `ITokenService` — never in Domain.
- New commands that need **new** domain or contract members: stop and ask (architecture guard).
